      "text": "Figure 1 (right): PubHealthBench-FreeForm model accuracy with 95% Wilson confidence intervals. Performance drops dramatically compared to MCQA, with top model o1 scoring 74% and all other models scoring below 72% (clinical guidance dropping to 57-71%).",
